1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,293
WOMAN: Hi, my name is Sarah Ferguson,

2
00:00:02,293 --> 00:00:08,189
and I made a reservation for a non-smoking room with a view of the river for two nights.

3
00:00:08,189 --> 00:00:12,651
MAN: I'm terribly sorry, Ms. Ferguson, but our staff must have made a mistake,

4
00:00:12,651 --> 00:00:15,140
because according to the information in the computer

5
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:18,070
your room is facing the park, not the river.

6
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:22,240
WOMAN: That's terrible. I was hoping to have a nice view of the river from my room.

7
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:28,000
Oh well, I guess mistakes happen. I'll just take the room facing the park then.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,977
MAN: Thank you. And to make up for our mistake,

9
00:00:30,977 --> 00:00:37,230
we would like to offer you a free dinner coupon for two at our hotel restaurant located on the basement floor.
